  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mad passion makes you almost impossible to distract.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Must have an insanity or worship the King in Yellow.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a +2 bonus on concentration checks. Once per day, you can cast a single spell, use a single bardic performance, or make a single Craft, Knowledge, Perform, or Profession skill check despite one of the following conditions: confused, dazed, dread, fear, fascinated, insanity, stunned.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythos-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
